descriptionBodyPlain:
 
At CI&T, we are seeking a highly skilled and motivated Mid-level Java Developer to join our team. You will contribute to an innovative international project in a collaborative, fast-paced, and results-driven environment.
 
As a Mid-level Java Developer, you will play a key role in designing and developing scalable backend solutions using Java and Spring Boot. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to ensure the delivery of high-quality software, leveraging your expertise in microservices and cloud technologies. Your contributions will be vital in enhancing system performance and reliability.
 
Key Responsibilities:
 
- Develop, test, and deploy software applications using Java, Spring Boot, and microservices architecture;
- Collaborate with stakeholders to define project requirements and technical solutions;
- Maintain and improve application performance, scalability, and reliability;
- Implement automated testing to ensure software quality;
- Work with NoSQL or document-based databases to manage data effectively;
- Utilize Docker for containerization and deployment of applications;
- Engage in DevOps practices to streamline development and operational processes.
 
Must-have Skills:
 
- Solid professional experience in Java development;
- Proficiency in Java, Spring Boot, APIs, microservices, Docker, and DevOps;
- Experience with NoSQL or document-based databases;
- Strong understanding of automated testing methodologies;
- Knowledge of messaging systems;
- Intermediate English proficiency.

